        {
          "content": "design\\releases\\0_0_5\\B_83_delete_card_reloads_project.md:20:`CardOperations.deleteCard` delegates to `ProjectFileOperations.deleteProjectFile`. Deletion flushes pending commits, repairs the following card's `after` link when needed, deletes the file, applies push mode, then calls `reloadCurrentProjectSnapshot`. That reload reads every project file and the repository index, rebuilds all cards, ensures internal IDs, and reloads agent conversations.\r\n",
