ys reports `Thinking-level capability API is not configured`.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:17:Result: supported built-in agents cannot satisfy the action-editor contract. Model and thinking-level controls become error-disabled instead of showing configured capabilities.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:27:- Make each configured agent profile the authoritative source for its model list.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:28:- Provide non-empty default model lists in the built-in Codex and Claude profiles. Users can override them through profile configuration.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:40:- A configured profile contains an empty list, duplicate values, or malformed values.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:42:- Existing action names a model removed from its configured profile.\\\\\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\feature_descriptions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\B_048_action_capability_provider_apis_missing.md:46:- Selecting supported Codex and Claude agents loads models from their configured profiles, including built-in defaults.\\\\\\\\napp\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\src\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\use_app_bootstrap.test.ts:8:import { configService } from '../services/config/config_service'\\\\\\\\napp\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\src\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\use_app_bootstrap.test.ts:43:        loadProjectConfig: vi.fn(async () => ({ backgroundShade: 'blue' as const, projectFolder: '', workingFolder: 'design' })),\\\\\\\\napp\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\src\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\use_app_bootstrap.test.ts:49:        saveProjectConfig: vi.fn(),\\\\\\\\napp\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\src\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\