        },
        {
          "content": "codex --model gpt-5.6-sol -c model_reasoning_effort=medium --sandbox workspace-write --ask-for-approval on-request --search exec resume --json 019fcddc-6476-7ee3-a5c4-1f50a192268e",
          "id": "agent-turn-8b1f34f1-f870-43fa-81aa-2eb2907f5478-started",
          "kind": "event",
          "sequence": 239,
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T09:10:54.510Z",
          "type": "started"
        },
        {
          "agent": "codex",
          "content": "The other action statuses currently defined are:\n\n- `cancelled`\n- `okButNotAfter`\n- `queued`\n- `running`\n\nOf these, only `cancelled` is also a valid persisted conversation status. `okButNotAfter` belongs to the broader action run, not the conversation schema.\n\nMy recommendation:\n\n- Mark unseen: `waitingForInput`, `completed`, `failed`\n- Do not mark unseen: `queued`, `running`, `cancelled`, `okButNotAfter`\n\nSo the document should replace “such as” with “specifically.”",
