          "type": "closed"
        },
        {
          "content": "1. ok\n2. the error is that is not managed by cardActionPopupService, so yes counts as visible\n3. no, I don't even understand why you are asking this. without reason, why would change the pattern?\n4. yes\n5. don't roll ui back, the user needs to know about the state. try to save again later\n6. yes project level as well\n7. no, why do you even ask this?\n8. i don't understand the issue here: new project resets the state of all data, no?\n\n`approval-driven waitingForInput` what does this mean?\n\n\\`\\`\\`\npersist a checkpoint before publishing that state, or the conversation may not exist yet when its view state is written.\n\\`\\`\\`\nthis is only a problem if we consider the file on disk to be the true source of truth. why are we doing this? we have the memory object no?&#x20;",
