          "content": "Resolved: migrate the list-editor card conversation popup into `CardActionPopupService`. All card conversation popups will then share the same visibility and stacking rules.\n\n3. Git commits for view changes\n\nShould changing `viewed`:\n\n- Only update the activity file, to be included in a later normal activity commit? Recommended.\n- Or immediately create and potentially push a dedicated Git commit?\n\nThe first avoids generating commits whenever someone opens or covers a chat.\n\n",
