        {
          "agent": "codex",
          "content": "Change Plan created. No edits made.\n\n1. Contract + persistence  \n   Add `viewed`; parser normalization; targeted queued update; preserve stored value during both checkpoint and terminal upserts. Tests included.\n\n2. Runner + bridges  \n   Persist approval checkpoint before event; add local, preload, remote-control forwarding. Tests included.\n\n3. Acknowledgement service  \n   Replace localStorage timestamps with transient per-conversation state; scoped events; qualifying transitions; optimistic rollback/retry; project reset; remove rename handling. Tests included.\n\n4. Popup visibility  \n   Track stable popup entry/topmost status; move list-editor popup into service; acknowledge displayed conversations only when fully visible; update leaf/button subscriptions and unseen selection. Tests included.\n\n5. Verification + status  \n   Run related tests and affected lint only. Then set feature `status: ready`.\n\nCall-site findings:\n\n- Both activity upsert callers need new preserve-stored-`viewed` behavior.\n- All parser consumers receive missing-as-true normalization.\n- Only list-editor card popup moves into service. Project/search/folder popups stay outside.\n\nSpecified doubled `design\\design` path does not exist. Actual file found at `C:\\Users\\janbo\\Documents\\dev\\md2\\design\\feature_descriptions\\F_140_persist_conversation_view_state.md`; status update will target actual file.\n\nApprove blocks to start.\n\n",
